  "detail_text": "The U.S. Embassy Baghdad (the Government) is seeking information from industry to assist with the development, planning, design, and implementation of a comprehensive studio facility. The purpose of this Request for Information (RFI) is to gather industry expertise and capabilities to help the Embassy develop requirements, specifications, and budget estimates for a complete studio setup. This market research is intended to identify all capable sources.",
